4. Retry changes the traffic equation
Suppose:
100 requests/sec
Payment starts failing.
You configure:
maxAttempts = 3
Each request can become:
attempt 1 -> failure
attempt 2 -> failure
attempt 3 -> failure
Potential traffic:
So:
incoming traffic = 100 RPS
downstream traffic = up to 300 RPS
This is retry amplification.
If the dependency is failing because it is overloaded, you've just made the situation worse.
