28. A useful design question
Ask:
"Does the circuit breaker measure logical requests or physical dependency attempts?"
If:
logical request = one business operation
then breaker-outside-retry may be more natural.
If:
each downstream attempt should influence health
then breaker-inside-retry may be appropriate.
This is a semantic decision, not merely a framework configuration.
